{"server":"cn","storyId":"act37side_level_act37side_st02","groupId":"act37side","stageId":"act37side_st02","title":"童话的结局","storyCode":"GO-ST-2","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"e1a088fef099b3581ca9fd067615c6456b57dbd44029275bb215a9b10a3d27d0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g7_repairedlentiavenue"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>诺伯特区街道</><p=2>1098年12月26日 5:23 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，你那边情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎恩老大还活着，但瘸了条腿。他最好的兄弟，没挺过来，我问了当初那些老熟人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人知道他那个兄弟具体什么时候走的，可能是当初逃离诺伯特区时，也可能是联军反攻时被走投无路的萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你见到黎恩老大了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见了，他现在在货港干活。他不怎么提起过去的日子了，也绝口不提自己的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他觉得，如今得好好活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......*维多利亚粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也去以前罩着的厂子逛了一圈，多了些毛头小子，甚至都没听说过我们格拉斯哥帮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那帮崽子可真是欠揍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你去那间我们常去的老餐馆了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆了。议会那边派人来联系了街区许多店铺的原主人，烂得没法修的，原主人也找不到的，都准备拆了重建。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"日落街酒店，保罗的酒吧，那个卡西米尔小崽子开的杂志铺......都没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还去了他们说的那片公共墓地，我没找到麦克拉伦，也没找到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哽咽）他妈的，为什么那些墓碑都不刻上名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的，我怎么能在你面前哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我们回家。摩根恐怕都等不及了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以为......拳馆的状况会更糟些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你一直都有在帮忙看管。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想着，如果你们还活着，迟早有天得回来......不管怎么说，我也算格拉斯哥帮的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你当初没有和我们一起上温德米尔公爵的军舰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没废物到需要那些公爵贵族来救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过......我得承认，当时我的确有点傻。后来，我带着一伙兄弟一直在诺伯特区周围干那些魔族佬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从那些魔族佬嘴里听说了典范军的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们做了件我从来都不敢想的事，哈，军队......外面战场翻天覆地的时候，我也和其他人去前线做了点事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们能做到的很有限，最后还受了些伤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也感染了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......听说因陀罗不也是因为不久前在战场上受了伤才感染的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你们这些朋友在，她可真走运。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"摩根愣住了，因为她从没想过这个问题。甚至连因陀罗自己都没想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，不对，怎么听你这么说感觉怪怪的。呃，可我一下也弄不清你哪说得不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，随便吧。反正如果有机会，替我对推进之王说声对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以留下，自己跟她说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的格拉斯哥帮已经不在了，既然你们都回来了，我也该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩没和你们回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她陪在维娜身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，看来你们也闹了一架。我从广播里听说了戴菲恩她妈妈的事......不管她身份是啥，至少她是个有种的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你接下来去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诺伯特区重建还需要人手，货港每天都有货要从城外运进来，我和我的兄弟们还得看着点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后......然后再去把中央区来的混账商人们揍一顿——呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧。摩根，诺伯特区已经变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我熟悉的人不在了，常去的店也没了，街区里新冒出来一帮屁都不懂的小崽子妄图争个高下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——反正，拳馆我还给你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"广播里议会说了很多新鲜事，我和几个兄弟谈好了，等过段时间就去其他公爵领看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会找到新地盘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡铎尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的地盘，新的开始。我得花点时间才能忘记有些事情......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，刚刚出去的，是卡铎尔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他来和我们告别，顺带把它还给我们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她掏出了一柄蝴蝶刀，上面有些残缺，但依旧可以清晰看到格拉斯哥帮的标记。\n贝尔德的蝴蝶刀——汉娜不会认错，上面的标记，还是当初她打赢贝尔德后非要刻上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡铎尔从一个死掉的清理人身上找到了它......但他搜遍了那片地方，也没有找到贝尔德。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也去了那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只在墙上找到些看不懂的东西，又下过雨，冲刷得差不多了。但我很肯定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她去过那，我认得她写的字——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我也希望”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>“我也希望。”</i>\n<i>贝尔德希望着什么？我们几个人盘算了很久也搞不清。</i>\n<i>她的愿望，已经顺着雨水回到了诺伯特区的土地上。</i>\n<i>我们决定不再试图弄清楚这件事。</i>\n<i>至少，她留住了自己最后的小秘密，我们永远也没机会猜到了。</i>\n<i>贝尔德现在一定又在嘲笑我们。</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，我们在录像厅看片子的时候，贝尔德最讨厌那些哭唧唧的悼念场面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，她从不觉得死亡，是值得悲伤的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把刀给我吧，我想办法挂在墙上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去拿酒。庆祝回家，也敬贝尔德！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们要不要等等维娜？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没空回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可万一呢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们就等到彻底喝醉之前，汉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒，从来不等人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>那天，我们谁也没说，但都很默契地喝得很慢。</i>\n<i>我们都在等一个人。</i>\n<i>我们似乎聊了很多。但那天宿醉之后，我们却什么都记不起来。</i>\n<i>我只记得汉娜和我打了一架，达格达的眉角也受了伤。为什么？我们谁都记不起来。</i>\n<i>要是维娜在就好了，她总是最清醒的那个人，她总是会替我们记得。</i>\n<i>但她没有回来。</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人我弄回来了，老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......真的不会出事吗？毕竟，从议会的眼皮子底下把死刑犯的尸体弄走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有某些人默许，你觉得凭你真能把人弄出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个哥伦比亚人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情绪不是很好......老大，确定这批货要让他来运吗？万一——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“铣痕”什么话也没说，佣兵叹了一口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了......老大，我不是想故意惹你生气，只是议会对我们动过一次手后，大家都还有些后怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......和你们无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个哥伦比亚人，我会搞定的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奥先生，想必我不用向你介绍自己了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“铣痕”......我知道你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，那我就不费口舌了。我需要你掩护我的一批货离开伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，不是没有回报。我可以顺带帮你把那个“死掉”的人一起送出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离伦蒂尼姆远远的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫黛安，“铣痕”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我眼里，她是谁都不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，她不会再出现在伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你把这叫做回报？让一个刚刚回家的人必须离开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奥先生，你很清楚她不能留在城里。对所有人而言，她已经死了，死在了绞刑架上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜办了件蠢事。只要这个人还活着，只要她还在城内，迟早会变成某些人捅向维娜的刀子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，维娜应该更果决些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奥先生，她的感染状况你比我清楚，她本就活不长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你可以不做。但这个麻烦，我还是会帮维娜解决，用我的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说过你的传说，“铣痕”，或者说，阿勒黛·坎伯兰阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的故事有很多版本，但无一例外，你曾经的确称得上是“永远高洁的坎伯兰”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我会带黛安走，我在哥伦比亚能更好地帮上她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你满意了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个善良的人，埃利西奥先生。有你做朋友，是她的幸运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准备好，你随时可能会出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要么像个英雄一样死去，要么活下来眼睁睁看着自己变成恶人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的你，会想到自己变成如今这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，又何止是我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“铣痕”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1342_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一场仗，活下来的英雄又何止千万。从最光芒闪耀的，到已经无人铭记的，我也想看看，在现实面前，他们都会变成什么样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"narration","text":"深陷在草地里的士兵感觉到了微微的瘙痒，寒风握住草尖轻轻挠着她的脸庞。\n死后的大地就是这样吗？她睁开了眼，却看到了意外的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸——啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，埃利西奥。黛安小姐，你不该招呼都不打，就自顾自地做些危险的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我记得我在绞刑架上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确死了，在那些目睹了行刑现场的人眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开前我拜托罗德岛的人重新检查了你的感染状况，结果并不乐观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身体的许多重要器官都已经结晶化。换而言之，源石替代了你的许多重要器官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......我没死？......这算幸运，还是不幸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不确定议长阁下是不是提前知道这个才......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是维娜放了我？她真傻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我真有些弄不懂你们这些人了。唉......不过抱歉，黛安小姐，恐怕你不能再回伦蒂尼姆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她此时才终于确认，他们已经不在伦蒂尼姆了。她看到了不远处那条移动城市碾过的巨大辙印。\n而前方，萨卡兹的孩子们在草地上奔跑，向她招手。\n背井离乡的萨卡兹大都眼神迷茫，他们能去任何地方，可哪都不会是他们的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黛安小姐，我会带你去哥伦比亚，在那里我或许能更好地帮助你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好呀。哥伦比亚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，我说过如果有机会，我很乐意去看看你口中的哥伦比亚到底是怎样的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奥先生，我们离哥伦比亚有多远？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，很远，让我拿地图出来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的状况，还能够坚持走到那里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。能答应我一件事吗，埃利西奥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想说什么，黛安小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到那天，我会带你回家，回到伦蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奥","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也很好奇，那时候，伦蒂尼姆又会变成什么样呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>回到拳馆喝醉的那天，我做了一个梦。</i>\n<i>梦里有一间富丽堂皇的墓室，里面的铭牌上刻印着我们的名字——</i>\n<i>“摩根”，凯特·莫瑞根        “因陀罗”，汉娜·杰克森</i>\n<i>“达格达”，伊莎贝尔·孟塔古        “贝尔德”，布里姬特·卢坎</i>\n<i>墓室外燃烧的轿车上，却坐着一头金色的狮子，他在叫着我的名字。</i>\n<i>维娜·维多利亚。</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......维娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......被子，谁给我盖了被子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔，头好痛，现在什么时候了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，我不是说过，别总是傻乎乎地喝这么多吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈，汉娜她们大咧咧的，你不该看着她们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？维娜？维娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"摩根矫捷地从沙发上弹射而起，越过矮矮的桌子扑向了维娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为，我以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以为什么呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"汉娜，你怎么不叫醒我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"昨天不是你嚷嚷着说，维娜绝对不会回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，结果现在最激动的是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘴硬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小声点，摩根，达格达还没醒呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（唔......）"},{"type":"narration","text":"枕在因陀罗腿上的人动了动耳朵，依旧沉醉在酒精的美梦里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看起来达格达喝的是最多的，我收拾出来不少空瓶子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她心情很糟，维娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，希望我没有迟到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然没有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你昨天可不是这么说的，摩根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（闭嘴，汉娜！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎回家，维娜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g2_glasgowoldroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想更快地赶回来，但是议会实在有太多的麻烦事需要处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你怎么又......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，只能暂时辛苦号角小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她恐怕现在才知道我偷偷溜出来了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你岂不是......还是要回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能逃避责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也欠你们一个道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你不用——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，推进之王？维娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我睡了多久？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，还没久到错过维娜回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......墙上那把蝴蝶刀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她的。卡铎尔送回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡铎尔？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>那一整天，维娜都没有再提起过要回去的事，但我们都知道——</i>\n<i>推进之王维娜，格拉斯哥帮的老大，“揍歪下巴”的常胜王，我最好的朋友（之一）随时都可能离我们而去。</i>\n<i>所以我恨不得抓紧一切时间告诉维娜，所有诺伯特区她还来不及了解的变化......</i>\n<i>卡铎尔，黎恩老大，录像厅......</i>\n<i>新修的货港，翻修的商店，闻讯赶回家的极少数老熟人......</i>\n<i>当然，还有些没见识的小崽子想要“罩着我们拳馆”，被维娜笑眯眯地赤手空拳揍回了家后，主动搬来了几箱酒赔罪，想要加入我们——</i>\n<i>诺伯特区似乎正在遗忘我们，但我却不觉得是件坏事。</i>\n<i>战争的确结束了。</i>"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还记得这个地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要不还是比比，这次谁更快？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"维娜话还没有说完，因陀罗已经窜了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汉娜，你作弊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她又没说要数数。老位子还是我的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你受过伤之后，明显慢了，因陀罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等你追上我再说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？等等我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别掉队，戴菲恩，跟上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听到了吗，“小戴菲”，你可慢了不少！"},{"type":"narration","text":"几道身影快速地在街区闪过，回家的工人们都有些好奇地看着这群张扬的人。\n他们实在想不起来，这帮人是谁——\n“又是些刚刚搬来诺伯特区的外地人吧，也许。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i13_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"工厂间的高架之上，格拉斯哥帮回到了她们熟悉的地方。\n在这，她们能俯瞰低矮的工厂，也能遥望到中央区碎片大厦高耸的尖角。\n她们从这起步，也从这告别家乡。兜兜转转，她们又回到了熟悉的地方。\n只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给贝尔德也留了一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达，你不再来点吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要。我不想再在维娜面前失态一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那刚好你那份，全分给维娜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“小戴菲”，你确定只喝果汁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，别这么叫我。我想我还是不太习惯酒味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随便，反正我会看着你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好耶！就他妈该在这喝酒才对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬贝尔德！敬格拉斯哥帮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"所有人","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬贝尔德！敬格拉斯哥帮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬罗德岛！敬典范军！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬所有在这场战争中战斗的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，还有，敬所有愿意豁出生命走回家的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬所有活着的，离去的人......敬所有依旧陪伴在我们身边的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——敬每一位付出过努力与泪水的人，每一位在黑暗与痛苦中挣扎过的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......敬维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"所有人","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬维多利亚！"},{"type":"narration","text":"不应悲伤。活着的人铭记当下，离去的人也留下了希望。\n羽兽们盘旋着低吟，附和着她们的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩，你也要走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是暂时的，我得回一趟丽茵卡登。希勒少尉会和我一起回去疗养。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你要是被你家里那些混账家伙气得不轻，随时可以回这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也是你的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然！我还答应了维娜呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，如果有一天你实在不想扛了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想，我还能做些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望伦蒂尼姆的人都能幸福快乐，也希望人人都能过上真正美好的生活，这是他们应得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都应该像我们一样笑，没有眼泪，也没有饥饿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想让我们所取得的一切白费——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有人想抢，我就打回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像过去我们在这里做的那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜也好，亚历山德莉娜也罢，对我而言，没有什么区别，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"维娜","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是贝尔德还在，她也一定希望我这样做吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i13_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，维娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也希望如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敬格拉斯哥帮，敬你们大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贝尔德","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欢迎回家，各位。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_i13_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>维娜是在第二天早上离开的。她没有让我们送她，或许她不想吵醒我们。</i>\n<i>但其实大家都醒着。我看着她换上了那套我不喜欢的衣服，独自走向了中央区。</i>\n<i>我希望维娜睡了这么久以来最安稳的一次觉。毕竟只有在家时，她才可以什么都不用想。</i>\n<i>我花了一整夜的时间仔细写下了维娜回家那天发生的每一件事，事无巨细。</i>\n<i>我想，总有一天，维娜你会看到我写下的这些文字。</i>\n<i>也许派不上什么大用场，但总归能替你记住一些容易被遗忘的东西。</i>\n<i>维娜，还记得我之前写的，那个梦吗？</i>\n<i>梦里有一间富丽堂皇的墓室，里面的铭牌上刻印着我们的名字——</i>\n<i>墓室外燃烧的轿车上，却坐着一头金色的狮子，他在叫着我的名字。</i>\n<i>维娜·维多利亚。</i>\n<i>我梦到了我是你。</i>\n<i>我梦到了在我的暮年之际，在已经与格拉斯哥帮的朋友们失去了联系数十年的某个下午......</i>\n<i>我走进了“推进之王”为格拉斯哥帮所建造的墓室。</i>\n<i>我怀念那段我刻骨铭心却又不再属于我的记忆，怀念那段发生在诺伯特区的故事。</i>\n<i>维娜，从你穿上那件衣服的那天起，我就知道......</i>\n<i>你终究会独自走下去，也只能独自走下去。</i>\n<i>抱歉，我们没办法帮上你，也没办法一直陪着你......</i>\n<i>但我想让你知道，我们会永远在这里。</i>\n<i>格拉斯哥帮会永远在这里。</i>\n<i>敬你，维娜·维多利亚。</i>\n<i>——《亚历山德莉娜回忆录》</i>\n<i>凯特·莫瑞根著</i>"}],"observedOperators":[]}
